// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Shadowstar 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1868937738" "Shadowstar"
// ProfessionString :
"P2320303917" "Warshade Facilitator"
// DescriptionString :
"P3664940134" "Long before the Peacebringers arrived on Earth, Nictus who sought to change their ways passed along the legend of the Shadowstar.  It was said that one of the first to turn away from the path of the Nictus found refuge in a priestess of an ancient Egyptian moon-cult, and that the two of them discovered the path of the Warshade as a way to defend themselves from the Nictus that hunted them.  The stories say that this same being has survived through the millennia, passed from mother to daughter along an unbroken family line stretching back to the old kingdoms of the Nile.  Nictus who sought a new life would often go in search of the Shadowstar, hoping to learn the way of the Warshade from her. <br><br>It is not known if the Warshade who calls herself Shadowstar has been inspired by this myth to help her fellow Kheldians, or if the legend is true and she is the latest in an ancient line.  Either way, Shadowstar works tirelessly to help Warshades find their path and start their new lives.  Though she has no official rank or power among her fellows, many Warshades defer to her, and the wise listen to her advice."
// ContactRequiresText :
"P1670354328" "You are of the wrong alignment to get this contact."
// HelloString :
"P1676517404" "Blessings upon you, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P4140619977" "I am always glad to see you, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P4006821658" "I greet you, {HeroName}, and hope that you fare well."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P478174161" "You must excuse us if we appear secretive, {HeroName}, but we Warshades are often looked upon with suspicion.  Though we have turned away from a far darker path, those shadows still cling to us.  It is only natural that we tend to keep to ourselves.  Just remember that every Warshade is comprised of both a Kheldian energy being and a human from this world.  This place is our home, too, and we wish to do well by it."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1684194686" "When a Nictus leaves that dark path behind, the universe itself sings with joy.  I greet you, {HeroName}, on the first day of your new life."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2364610008" "You have done so much that I'm out of things worthy of your time and effort.  But you've made new friends who need your help.  Maybe you should talk to them?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1259862815" "Don't get too ambitious, {HeroName}.  Finish what you've started, and when you have more time come back to talk to me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1165895951" "I have something, but I don't think you're powerful enough to handle it yet.  Come back when your security level is higher, and I'll see what we can do.  It is generally a good idea to check in with me about every 5 security levels or so.  I may have heard of new developments in existing cases."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1662615943" "You are now truly on the path, {HeroName}.  And any who have left the Nictus behind is someone I am glad to call a friend.  If there is anything you need, <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>let me know.</A> Please call on me if you ever need assistance."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P839492030" "I remember when you came to us, you were so confused and uncertain.  Now when I look in your eyes that uncertainty is gone.  In it's place is a growing confidence that will see you through many dark days ahead.  I will be glad to help you with <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>anything you need</A>."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P885423332" "We are done for now, {HeroName}, but all good things never truly end.  I know that we will see each other again."
// LocationString :
"P2752802251" "Atlas Park"
// IntroString :
"P691296237" "This should not appear for this contact."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3746142129" "You've already started to earn people's trust, {HeroName}.  In fact, <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone's already started to ask if you might be willing to talk to them</A>."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


