// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Sunstorm 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Sunstorm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P93035954" "Sunstorm"
// ProfessionString :
"P4021035962" "Peacebringer Coordinator"
// DescriptionString :
"P2798847049" "When the Kheldian warrior called Perihelion arrived on Earth, it sought a human warrior with courage and strength to match it's own as a host.  When it spied a uniformed human facing certain death against insurmountable odds to stop a tide of unliving monsters, it thought that it had found a soldier who would be a perfect match.  It offered the embattled Sgt. Benjamin Carter the opportunity to bond, and form a powerful Kheldian Peacebringer.  The two joined in that moment to form the being called Sunstorm, and handily defeated the surrounding Vahzilok. <br><br>What Perihelion didn't realize was that Sgt. Carter wasn't a soldier like it expected, but an upstanding member of the Paragon City Police Department.  As a result, Sunstorm is not as martial and merciless as Perihelion, having been tempered by Carter's high ideals.  This has turned out to be quite a blessing.  Sunstorm is often able to see new solutions to problems. <br><br>Sunstorm usually coordinates the activities of his fellow Peacebringers on Earth.  While he holds no real rank over the rest of his kind, wise Peacebringers listen to what he has to say."
// ContactRequiresText :
// HelloString :
"P3055841588" "Your powers are integrating well, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P2675544829" "Are you ready to do your duty as a Peacebringer?"
// HelloString :
"P3612846184" "There's a lot of work out there for Peacebringers, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3655078801" "Yes, {HeroName}.  I am a Peacebringer.  I know you're concerned by our presence, but I assure you, we're here to help.  Since every Peacebringer is formed by fusing a Kheldian alien and a human from Earth, in many ways this is our home world, too.  We want to see Earth free and peaceful just as much as you do."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2754716532" "Welcome to the start of your new life as a Peacebringer.  I know you probably have a lot of questions, so let's get started."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2853431356" "You've gotten strong enough to stand on your own without my help, {HeroName}.  There are others out there that need your help more."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1033832487" "You've been keeping busy, {HeroName}, but don't overdo it.  You need to finish all of your other tasks before I can give you more to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P85215931" "I'm going to need your help for something soon, but I'd feel better if you developed your powers more before I gave it to you.  Check back with me at roughly 5 Security level intervals.  There may be new things for you to do."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2331437598" "You're already doing great work, {HeroName}.  I think you'll soon prove yourself as a real friend to the people of Earth.  If you <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>need anything,</A> I'll see what I can help you with.  Just call on me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1145500394" "You're well on your way as a Peacebringer, {HeroName}.  As always, I'm ready to provide whatever <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>support</A> you'll need to carry on the fight."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2720089148" "Your powers have really grown, {HeroName}.  You need to seek your own challenges now.  I have every confidence that you'll uphold the high standards of the Peacebringers no matter what you do."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1259626758" "Word of your abilities is getting around.  I have a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>new contact</A> who's heard of you, and would like your help."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P345232534" "Your reputation as a Peacebringer is getting around.  I have several <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>new contacts</A> who are asking for your assistance specifically."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

